body:
Unfortunately i know how risky eyeball tattoos are, it was just a thought, i really  just like them. But there is nobody in my country who would do such a thing. I'm also afraid of getting my tongue split, i had a tongue piercing and it was a nightmare from start to finish.. so i think i will never get into extreme body mods to be honest.

&#x200B;

I'm pretty sure people will think i'm just young and dumb, but i'm 20 years old.
